{"4931390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Don't Go Duck", "steam_appid": 4931390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ducks can fall in love too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem is that one day, that love was kidnapped by an eagle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't Go Duck</strong> is an adventure about a small yellow duck leaping into the sky to rescue his beloved girlfriend. His opponent is the king of the skies: an eagle. Our hero is a duck. On paper, the matchup looks pretty hopeless, but this duck does not worry about numbers. After all, the dice are in charge of those.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the duck through the clouds, across precarious platforms, and up a path that keeps climbing higher and higher. Do not let the cute face fool you. This duck is very serious about love, and gravity has absolutely no respect for that seriousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The goal is simple.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Climb up. Do not fall. Lead the duck down the right path and rescue his girlfriend.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Easy to say. As always, only easy to say.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A tiny, adorable duck’s very big rescue mission.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A dangerous road through the sky, annoying gravity, and a love stolen by an eagle.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931390/extras/bc923c57478315d93debeab13bb1aeae.avif?t=1785429067\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931390/extras_big/bc923c57478315d93debeab13bb1aeae.webp?t=1785429067 width=1560 height=873 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After everything that lies ahead, will the duck be able to rescue his girlfriend? Let out one brave quack, and leap. Love does not wait, and eagles have no manners.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ducks can fall in love too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem is that one day, that love was kidnapped by an eagle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't Go Duck</strong> is an adventure about a small yellow duck leaping into the sky to rescue his beloved girlfriend. His opponent is the king of the skies: an eagle. Our hero is a duck. On paper, the matchup looks pretty hopeless, but this duck does not worry about numbers. After all, the dice are in charge of those.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the duck through the clouds, across precarious platforms, and up a path that keeps climbing higher and higher. Do not let the cute face fool you. This duck is very serious about love, and gravity has absolutely no respect for that seriousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The goal is simple.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Climb up. Do not fall. Lead the duck down the right path and rescue his girlfriend.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Easy to say. As always, only easy to say.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A tiny, adorable duck’s very big rescue mission.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A dangerous road through the sky, annoying gravity, and a love stolen by an eagle.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931390/extras/bc923c57478315d93debeab13bb1aeae.avif?t=1785429067\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931390/extras_big/bc923c57478315d93debeab13bb1aeae.webp?t=1785429067 width=1560 height=873 /></sp